  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"119\" height=\"40\"></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>1.21.4 及以上版本可使用資源包&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/theones-eating-animation-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Theone's Eating Animation Pack</a></em></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Eating Animation - 一款為可食用與飲用物品新增貼圖動畫的模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Eating Animation 為純客戶端模組！！！&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>單人遊戲中可正常運作：</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pA3iI8d.gif\" width=\"1167\" height=\"778\"></em></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>多人遊戲中也支援！：</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lUafo7V.gif\" width=\"1173\" height=\"782\"></strong></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>要使模組支援功能正常運作，您需要啟用此資源包</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>（資源包已內建於 Minecraft 中）</strong></span><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mkXq5GI.png\" width=\"509\" height=\"228\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>支援的模組列表：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-pluss\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Food +</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Winterly</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Farmer's Delight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Botania</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Hybrid Aquatic</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-bumblezone-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- The Bumblezone</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Additional Additions</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Adorn</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">- BetterEnd</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">- BetterNether</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Create</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duckling\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Duckling</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Expanded Delight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Naturalist</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Snow Pig</a></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;我的其他模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minerally\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/834/638247404326048327.gif\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-pluss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/795/95/638154314085492278.gif\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/banilla-claws\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/877/103/638301712170926405.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ktDEUwS.png\"></a></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">如何為 Eating Animation 模組設定資源包動畫！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/theones-items-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的資源包支援 Eating Animation 模組</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VB-fj2ITVYQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"295\" width=\"295\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如何設定自訂模型資料的動畫 -&nbsp;<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Ico2DYjiVY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"295\" width=\"295\"></iframe></span></strong></span><br><span style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QRjSa1h.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Forge 移植版：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animation [Forge]</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>感謝以下朋友協助撰寫程式碼：</strong> <strong>spusik_, PinkGoosik 與 DoctorNight1&nbsp;\\ (&bull;◡&bull;) /</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>ඞ</p>",
